## 1. What Works

### Chatbot Flows
- **Order Status Flow** (Vhanje Muofhe)
  - Bot responds correctly to "Where is my order?" queries
  - Returns accurate order tracking information
  - Handles variations of the query successfully

- **Returns & Refunds Flow** (Emmanuel Argut)
  - Bot explains return steps clearly
  - Provides accurate refund timeline to users
  - Covers standard return scenarios

- **Fallback Response** (Rhoda Mwikali + Emmanuel Argut)
  - Bot replies with escalation message when query is not matched
  - Users are directed to human support agent successfully
  - No dead ends in conversation flow

